":6,"document":7,"postSlices":503},"saudi-arabia",{"titleTag":8,"metaDescription":9,"canonical":10,"subpath1":11,"subpath2":21,"slices":28},"Send a Parcel to Saudi Arabia from the UK | Fast & Reliable Courier Service","Looking to send a parcel to Saudi Arabia? Evri offers easy, reliable delivery to Riyadh, Jeddah, and beyond. Enjoy full tracking, affordable prices, and a hassle-free experience. Start sending with Evri today.","saudi-arabia.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fsaudi-arabia",{"id":12,"type":13,"tags":14,"lang":15,"slug":16,"first_publication_date":17,"last_publication_date":17,"uid":16,"link_type":18,"key":19,"isBroken":20},"YhjzRRIAAC8A3CHH","subpath1",[],"en-gb","our-services","2022-02-25T15:18:32+0000","Document","1b8e75c5-bf23-406e-8dff-2353750036e3",false,{"id":22,"type":23,"tags":24,"lang":15,"slug":25,"first_publication_date":26,"last_publication_date":26,"uid":25,"link_type":18,"key":27,"isBroken":20},"YqChARIAACUAht8j","subpath2",[],"international-courier-services","2022-06-08T13:16:21+0000","efb7b4e7-e0d6-4b70-8200-ea3c031316d6",[29,70,111,137,175,252,263,302,388,419,455],{"variation":30,"version":31,"items":32,"primary":44,"id":68,"slice_type":69,"slice_label":46},"horizontalWidget","sktwi1xtmkfgx8626",[33,39],{"text":34,"link":35},"Send multiple parcels",{"link_type":36,"key":37,"url":38},"Web","2e72621e-20ff-40f4-8e85-b465f1d5af4c","saudi-arabia.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fcustomer\u002Fbulk-upload",{"text":40,"link":41},"Check our prohibited items",{"link_type":36,"key":42,"url":43},"39f3ad43-e5c7-4b10-bbaf-ab5fd1d2dbfa","saudi-arabia.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend\u002Fwhat-i-can-and-cannot-send",{"heading":45,"subheading":46,"promo_text":46,"textImage":47,"cardTitle":48,"card_subtitle":46,"destinationsCsv":49,"defaultCountryId":57,"monotypeTitle":58},"Shipping to Saudi Arabia",null,{},"from £12.99",{"link_type":50,"key":51,"kind":52,"id":53,"url":54,"name":55,"size":56},"Media","653063b9-efec-469d-b783-0cfad14deac3","file","ZCwNmBEAACIAAJpg","saudi-arabia.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fdf0da68b-7584-4eca-a656-20f4b8338e1a_destination_countries_030423.csv","destination_countries_030423.csv","5329","171",{"dimensions":59,"alt":46,"copyright":46,"url":62,"id":63,"edit":64},{"width":60,"height":61},88,24,"saudi-arabia.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F2a1dcc38-ecf2-4a6a-b68d-b28f33e8fe47_send+%281%29.svg","ZcyF-hIAACgAGOcv",{"x":65,"y":65,"zoom":66,"background":67},0,1,"transparent","international_hero_banner$b0b0a913-8201-43ad-bb8c-844e93019266","international_hero_banner",{"variation":71,"version":31,"items":72,"primary":74,"id":109,"slice_type":110,"slice_label":46},"cardWithImageNoCta",[73],{},{"CardImage":75,"CardAvatar":84,"CardTitle":85,"CardText":86,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":76,"alt":79,"copyright":46,"url":80,"id":81,"edit":82},{"width":77,"height":78},1000,667,"A landscape photo showing a river winding through a rocky-faced mountain range with lots of green shrubbery at the base.","saudi-arabia.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ7iTgp7c43Q3gErl_SaudiArabia.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=385%2C0%2C4603%2C3070&w=1000&h=667","Z7iTgp7c43Q3gErl",{"x":83,"y":65,"zoom":66,"background":67},385,"none","Send a parcel to Saudi Arabia",[87,92],{"type":88,"text":89,"spans":90,"direction":91},"paragraph","If you need to send a parcel from the UK to Saudi Arabia, we’re here to help. We offer a fast and reliable courier service to get your items from Riyadh to Jeddah and beyond. With our extensive network, it’s easy for you to send parcels quickly and safely in 10 to 15 working days. Plus, we include free tracking and parcel cover up to £20 with every delivery - you and your recipient can enjoy peace of mind from start to finish.",[],"ltr",{"type":88,"text":93,"spans":94,"direction":91},"If you’ve got orders to send to Oman or packages you need shipping to Bahrain, you can send to 200+ destinations internationally with us.",[95,101,103,108],{"start":61,"end":96,"type":97,"data":98},36,"hyperlink",{"link_type":36,"url":99,"target":100},"\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Foman","_blank",{"start":61,"end":96,"type":102},"strong",{"start":104,"end":105,"type":97,"data":106},58,77,{"link_type":36,"url":107,"target":100},"\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fbahrain",{"start":104,"end":105,"type":102},"card$bba4824a-b0d7-419b-9c3a-2fcdc9f7e789","card",{"variation":112,"version":31,"items":113,"primary":129,"id":135,"slice_type":136,"slice_label":46},"default-slice",[114,117,120,123,126],{"Col1Content":115,"Col2Content":116},"250g","£12.99",{"Col1Content":118,"Col2Content":119},"500g","£13.69",{"Col1Content":121,"Col2Content":122},"1kg","£21.69",{"Col1Content":124,"Col2Content":125},"2kg","£26.89",{"Col1Content":127,"Col2Content":128},"5kg+","£38.79",{"SectionTitle":130,"SectionSubtitle":131,"Col1Header":132,"Col2Header":133,"TableFooter":134,"isTableShort":20},"How much is shipping to Saudi Arabia?","Sending a parcel to Saudi Arabia from the UK? The price will depend on the size and weight of your items. You can send up to 15kg in our network. See how cheap it can be based on some of our more popular parcel weights:","Weight","Price","Prices quoted are ‘starting from’ and may change based on the volumetric weight of a parcel.","information_table$8a7bbe5e-2483-413c-82f3-470e0423b5ba","information_table",{"variation":138,"version":31,"items":139,"primary":140,"id":174,"slice_type":110,"slice_label":46},"cardNoImageWithCta",[],{"CardAvatar":84,"CardTitle":141,"CardText":142,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":172,"IsEco":20},"Public holidays in Saudi Arabia",[143,146,152,157,162,167],{"type":88,"text":144,"spans":145,"direction":91},"While our couriers aim to deliver parcels within 10 to 15 working days, delivery times can increase with local and public holidays in Saudi Arabia. We’d recommend checking if your parcel could be in transit around any of the following days and sending earlier to help avoid potential delays:",[],{"type":147,"text":148,"spans":149,"direction":91},"list-item","Eid al-Fitr - 20\u002F03\u002F2026 - 21\u002F03\u002F2026",[150],{"start":65,"end":151,"type":102},12,{"type":147,"text":153,"spans":154,"direction":91},"Arafat - 25\u002F05\u002F2026 - 26\u002F05\u002F2026",[155],{"start":65,"end":156,"type":102},7,{"type":147,"text":158,"spans":159,"direction":91},"Eid al-Adha - 26\u002F05\u002F2026 - 30\u002F05\u002F2026",[160],{"start":65,"end":161,"type":102},11,{"type":147,"text":163,"spans":164,"direction":91},"Islamic New Year (Al-Hijra) - 16\u002F06\u002F2026 - 17\u002F06\u002F2026",[165],{"start":65,"end":166,"type":102},28,{"type":147,"text":168,"spans":169,"direction":91},"Saudi National Day - 23\u002F09\u002F2026",[170],{"start":65,"end":171,"type":102},19,{"link_type":173},"Any","card$05499fff-fc4f-49d9-9202-57e54fb1665b",{"variation":176,"version":31,"items":177,"primary":240,"id":250,"slice_type":251,"slice_label":46},"3Column",[178,198,221],{"Title":179,"Description":184,"Image":188,"Label":46,"UrlText":182,"Url":194,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":197,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":46},[180],{"type":181,"text":182,"spans":183},"heading3","ParcelShops",[],[185],{"type":88,"text":186,"spans":187,"direction":91},"Book your delivery online and drop off your parcel at one of our 9,000+ ParcelShops near you. Conveniently located in corner shops and more, you can even print your label in-store for free. If you’d prefer to book in person, why not visit us at selected Post Offices?",[],{"dimensions":189,"alt":190,"copyright":46,"url":191,"id":192,"edit":193},{"width":77,"height":78},"Evri blue ParcelShop sign hung from the ceiling of a store in one of the aisles. Stock on shelves is visible in the background.","saudi-arabia.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJPZbqstJ9-Tf4_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2888.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6TJPZbqstJ9-Tf4",{"x":65,"y":65,"zoom":66,"background":67},{"link_type":36,"key":195,"url":196},"b9d5202f-5dde-4997-ab5c-bbb8fac27d10","\u002Fparcelshops",{"link_type":173},{"Title":199,"Description":203,"Image":207,"Label":46,"UrlText":201,"Url":217,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":220,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":46},[200],{"type":181,"text":201,"spans":202},"Lockers",[],[204],{"type":88,"text":205,"spans":206,"direction":91},"Our  secure, 24\u002F7 Lockers across the UK make it easy for you to drop off your parcel any time. Simply book online, head to your nearest location and scan your barcode. Place your package in an available space and we’ll send it on its way.",[],{"dimensions":208,"alt":210,"copyright":46,"url":211,"id":212,"edit":213},{"width":77,"height":209},672,"Woman opening blue locker to place cardboard box inside","saudi-arabia.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F29b7db01-898f-4593-93e3-93d72ee215b0_lockerimage2.jpg?auto=compress,format&rect=21,0,4960,3333&w=1000&h=672","Yh4ImxIAACgA8w-8",{"x":214,"y":65,"zoom":215,"background":216},-4,0.20162016201620162,"#fff",{"link_type":36,"key":218,"url":219},"a90b90e4-5fc0-4136-a026-44af6a7a70f0","\u002Fparcelshops\u002Flockers",{"link_type":173},{"Title":222,"Description":226,"Image":230,"Label":46,"UrlText":224,"Url":236,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":239,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":46},[223],{"type":181,"text":224,"spans":225,"direction":91},"Courier collection",[],[227],{"type":88,"text":228,"spans":229,"direction":91},"Did you know we can also collect your parcel from your doorstep? Book a courier collection online, choose a convenient day, and we’ll send a courier to pick up your parcel at your home or workplace. You’ll even get a one-hour collection  window, so you’ll know exactly when to expect us.",[],{"dimensions":231,"alt":232,"copyright":46,"url":233,"id":234,"edit":235},{"width":77,"height":78},"An Evri courier is delivering three parcels to a man at his doorstep. He looks pleased to be recieving them","saudi-arabia.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdGZbqstJ9-inj_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8036.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6zdGZbqstJ9-inj",{"x":65,"y":65,"zoom":66,"background":67},{"link_type":36,"key":237,"url":238},"8af911bf-26ca-4d61-bda0-cd6562434135","\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service",{"link_type":173},{"SectionTitle":241,"SectionDescription":246,"theme":46},[242],{"type":243,"text":244,"spans":245,"direction":91},"heading2","How to send a parcel to Saudi Arabia",[],[247],{"type":88,"text":248,"spans":249,"direction":91},"We’ve made shipping to Saudi Arabia easy with three options to choose from:",[],"article_link_module$380d507a-5f74-4888-80cd-627d9379f8f9","article_link_module",{"variation":138,"version":31,"items":253,"primary":255,"id":262,"slice_type":110,"slice_label":46},[254],{},{"CardAvatar":84,"CardTitle":256,"CardText":257,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":261,"IsEco":20},"How long does it take to send a parcel to Saudi Arabia?",[258],{"type":88,"text":259,"spans":260,"direction":91},"Parcels sent to Saudi Arabia usually take 10 to 15 working days with our Standard ParcelShop drop-off service. ",[],{"link_type":173},"card$8b9d5118-024d-4b2c-ae3b-e430dc424436",{"variation":112,"version":31,"items":264,"primary":266,"id":301,"slice_type":110,"slice_label":46},[265],{},{"CardImage":267,"CardAvatar":84,"CardTitle":273,"CardText":274,"ButtonText":298,"ButtonUrl":299,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":268,"alt":269,"copyright":46,"url":270,"id":271,"edit":272},{"width":77,"height":78},"Customer carrying multiple parcels inside a ParcelShop store, ready to drop off for delivery","saudi-arabia.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R1D5bqstJ9-SOx_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2468.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6R1D5bqstJ9-SOx",{"x":65,"y":65,"zoom":66,"background":67},"Send multiple parcels to Saudi Arabia",[275,278,288,293],{"type":88,"text":276,"spans":277,"direction":91},"Running a business or need to send several parcels? With our bulk integration tool, sending parcels is a breeze. Here’s how you can manage multiple packages:",[],{"type":279,"text":280,"spans":281,"direction":91},"o-list-item","Head over to our Bulk Integrations tool. Click ‘Link Account’ to connect your marketplace accounts like eBay, Etsy, Amazon, Shopify, or upload via CSV file.",[282,287],{"start":283,"end":284,"type":97,"data":285},17,40,{"link_type":36,"url":38,"target":286},"_self",{"start":283,"end":284,"type":102},{"type":279,"text":289,"spans":290,"direction":91},"Package and book your items online and print off your postage label at home or in-store with our free Print in ParcelShop device",[291],{"start":65,"end":292,"type":102},34,{"type":279,"text":294,"spans":295,"direction":91},"Drop off your parcels at any of our 10,000+ ParcelShops and Lockers, or schedule a courier collection.",[296],{"start":65,"end":297,"type":102},22,"View integrations",{"link_type":36,"key":300,"url":38},"09ecc96e-a928-42dc-ae32-e506e24e0a60","card$fa303a60-84d8-4787-b754-15518974d525",{"variation":303,"version":31,"items":304,"primary":382,"id":386,"slice_type":387,"slice_label":46},"listComponent",[305,322,334,346,358,370],{"title":306,"content":307,"icon":316},"Parcel tracking and notifications",[308],{"type":88,"text":309,"spans":310,"direction":91},"Check where your parcel is in its journey with end-to-end tracking for you and your recipient. We'll also send updates to your recipient at no extra cost, which means less time for you dealing with “where’s my parcel?” queries",[311,315],{"start":104,"end":312,"type":97,"data":313},66,{"link_type":36,"url":314,"target":100},"\u002Ftrack-a-parcel",{"start":104,"end":312,"type":102},{"dimensions":317,"alt":318,"copyright":46,"url":319,"id":320,"edit":321},{"width":284,"height":284},"Phone icon","saudi-arabia.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fd7cc2443-0047-4998-a550-fabf5e0f598a_phone.svg","Yh96FxIAACwA-Zse",{"x":65,"y":65,"zoom":66,"background":67},{"title":323,"content":324,"icon":328},"Parcel cover",[325],{"type":88,"text":326,"spans":327,"direction":91},"Every parcel you send includes £20 free cover. If your item’s worth more, you can easily increase the cover up to £999 for extra peace of mind",[],{"dimensions":329,"alt":330,"copyright":46,"url":331,"id":332,"edit":333},{"width":284,"height":284},"Money icon","saudi-arabia.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F41d7371a-386e-4d75-a28e-2ea118d1d0af_money.svg","Yh96FxIAAC8A-Zsd",{"x":65,"y":65,"zoom":66,"background":67},{"title":335,"content":336,"icon":340},"Customs made easier",[337],{"type":88,"text":338,"spans":339,"direction":91},"Fill in customs information as part of your online booking without needing to print anything extra - we'll do the rest",[],{"dimensions":341,"alt":342,"copyright":46,"url":343,"id":344,"edit":345},{"width":284,"height":284},"Passport icon","saudi-arabia.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F00399f73-6c8a-4398-a945-07eba83626df_important+documents.svg","Yh96GBIAAC4A-Zsv",{"x":65,"y":65,"zoom":66,"background":216},{"title":347,"content":348,"icon":352},"Flexible printing options",[349],{"type":88,"text":350,"spans":351,"direction":91},"Print your parcel labels at home or in-store for FREE using our Print in Store devices",[],{"dimensions":353,"alt":354,"copyright":46,"url":355,"id":356,"edit":357},{"width":284,"height":284},"Printer icon","saudi-arabia.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ffdc990f7-2855-4f2e-9ddb-97e26bf3eac3_print+at+home.svg","Yh96GBIAAC0A-Zsk",{"x":65,"y":65,"zoom":66,"background":216},{"title":359,"content":360,"icon":364},"Connect your marketplaces",[361],{"type":88,"text":362,"spans":363,"direction":91},"Connect your Evri account with eBay, Amazon, Etsy, Shopify, WooCommerce and more or upload a CSV to book multiple deliveries in one go. We'll even mark your orders as 'dispatched' update your customers with tracking information",[],{"dimensions":365,"alt":366,"copyright":46,"url":367,"id":368,"edit":369},{"width":284,"height":284},"Laptop icon","saudi-arabia.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ff4479625-5e04-45e8-9a20-77fa5893b64e_laptops.svg","Yh96GBIAAC8A-Zss",{"x":65,"y":65,"zoom":66,"background":67},{"title":371,"content":372,"icon":376},"Trusted by top UK brands",[373],{"type":88,"text":374,"spans":375,"direction":91},"We're trusted to deliver for many of the UK's biggest retailers like ASOS, Boohoo and Pretty Little Thing, just to name a few",[],{"dimensions":377,"alt":378,"copyright":46,"url":379,"id":380,"edit":381},{"width":284,"height":284},"Success icon","saudi-arabia.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8d947c5f-d007-4da4-b0c6-86691eda4240_success.svg","Yh96GBIAACwA-Zsm",{"x":65,"y":65,"zoom":66,"background":67},{"theme":383,"title":384,"description":385},"standard","Why send parcels to Saudi Arabia with Evri?","At Evri, we believe sending internationally should be as simple and stress-free as sending locally. When you send packages to Saudi Arabia with us, here’s what you can expect:","list_block$87389633-8af1-4da5-9f55-ee48a27248cd","list_block",{"variation":138,"version":31,"items":389,"primary":391,"id":418,"slice_type":110,"slice_label":46},[390],{},{"CardAvatar":84,"CardTitle":392,"CardText":393,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":417,"IsEco":20},"What you can and can’t send to Saudi Arabia",[394,402],{"type":88,"text":395,"spans":396,"direction":91},"While there are many items you can send to Saudi Arabia with Evri, make sure you check our list of items we don't cover before you send.",[397,401],{"start":398,"end":399,"type":97,"data":400},99,119,{"link_type":36,"url":43,"target":286},{"start":398,"end":399,"type":102},{"type":88,"text":403,"spans":404,"direction":91},"For the latest updates on restrictions, refer to the IATA Dangerous Goods Regulations and the UK Civil Aviation Authority.",[405,410,411,416],{"start":406,"end":407,"type":97,"data":408},53,85,{"link_type":36,"url":409,"target":286},"saudi-arabia.html\u002F\u002Fwww.iata.org\u002Fen\u002Fpublications\u002Fdgr\u002F",{"start":406,"end":407,"type":102},{"start":412,"end":413,"type":97,"data":414},94,121,{"link_type":36,"url":415,"target":286},"saudi-arabia.html\u002F\u002Fwww.caa.co.uk\u002Fpassengers\u002FBefore-you-fly\u002FBaggage\u002FBanned-items\u002F",{"start":412,"end":413,"type":102},{"link_type":173},"card$6f66a640-ac28-4892-9a46-df43b1ecb324",{"variation":71,"version":31,"items":420,"primary":421,"id":454,"slice_type":110,"slice_label":46},[],{"CardImage":422,"CardAvatar":84,"CardTitle":428,"CardText":429,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":423,"alt":424,"copyright":46,"url":425,"id":426,"edit":427},{"width":77,"height":78},"A side-view profile of a customer sitting on a sofa, with a laptop resting on their lap as they look down at the screen.","saudi-arabia.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6Xqi5bqstJ9-WcS_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5681.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6Xqi5bqstJ9-WcS",{"x":65,"y":65,"zoom":66,"background":67},"What address information do you need for shipping to Saudi Arabia?",[430,433,436,439,442,445,448,451],{"type":88,"text":431,"spans":432,"direction":91},"When shipping to Saudi Arabia, simply enter the recipient’s postcode as part of your booking and we’ll provide different address options for you to choose from.",[],{"type":88,"text":434,"spans":435,"direction":91},"We’ll make sure your label follows the correct format, ready for printing. All you need to do is check that you have the correct details below before confirming your order.",[],{"type":147,"text":437,"spans":438,"direction":91},"Recipient’s full name",[],{"type":147,"text":440,"spans":441,"direction":91},"Street address",[],{"type":147,"text":443,"spans":444,"direction":91},"City or town",[],{"type":147,"text":446,"spans":447,"direction":91},"Postal code",[],{"type":147,"text":449,"spans":450,"direction":91},"Country",[],{"type":88,"text":452,"spans":453,"direction":91},"We’ll provide all the relevant options when you enter the recipient’s postcode during booking.",[],"card$e33f27df-8761-457b-99a7-90e3916b6886",{"variation":112,"version":31,"items":456,"primary":499,"id":501,"slice_type":502,"slice_label":46},[457,475,487],{"questionTitle":458,"questionBody":459},"Do I need to deal with customs for Saudi Arabia?",[460,463,466],{"type":88,"text":461,"spans":462,"direction":91},"Some carriers ask you to print out a customs form and attach it to your parcel. Not with Evri. When you buy a parcel online, we automatically take all the information we need during checkout, making it even easier for you.",[],{"type":88,"text":464,"spans":465,"direction":91},"Be careful to fill in all the information correctly to make sure your parcel arrives at its destination as quickly as possible. If the information you provide is incorrect, it could result in your parcel being held at customs, with delays and charges outside of our control.",[],{"type":88,"text":467,"spans":468,"direction":91},"Check out our simple guide on how to send an international parcel for more information.",[469,474],{"start":470,"end":471,"type":97,"data":472},30,65,{"link_type":36,"url":473,"target":100},"\u002Fguides\u002Fhow-to-send-an-international-parcel",{"start":470,"end":471,"type":102},{"questionTitle":476,"questionBody":477},"Will import taxes apply to parcels sent to Saudi Arabia?",[478,481,484],{"type":88,"text":479,"spans":480,"direction":91},"Customs charges depend on the destination, purpose, contents, and value of your parcel.",[],{"type":88,"text":482,"spans":483,"direction":91},"As the sender, the price you pay will cover the delivery service of the parcel.",[],{"type":88,"text":485,"spans":486,"direction":91},"If customs charges are applicable, Evri or the relevant authorities will contact your recipient with a secure payment link to clear customs before they can receive their items.",[],{"questionTitle":488,"questionBody":489},"How can I track my parcel to Saudi Arabia?",[490],{"type":88,"text":491,"spans":492,"direction":91},"Tracking your parcel is easy with Evri. You and your recipient can track your parcel from start to finish. All you need to do is enter your tracking number on our international tracking page.",[493,498],{"start":494,"end":495,"type":97,"data":496},163,190,{"link_type":36,"url":497,"target":286},"saudi-arabia.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ftrack-a-parcel",{"start":494,"end":495,"type":102},{"title":500},"FAQs","frequently_asked_questions$57fefc8c-b2c9-4081-82a7-95a11a3df31f","frequently_asked_questions",[29,70,111,137,175,252,263,302,388,419,455],["Reactive",505],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":506,"$sclients":573,"$sglobal-basket-count":46,"$sglobal-user-postcode":576},{"abtasty":507,"accessibe":511,"appPromoBanner":514,"autoDivertUpdates":517,"awin":520,"bulkInternational":523,"bulkSendEnabled":526,"businessAccountForm75Enabled":529,"enableBasketCount":532,"enableBulkPhaseTwo":535,"euCustomsDuty":538,"groovyAdvert":541,"newInternationalSendFlow":544,"newinternationalpages":551,"oohPreferenceFlag":555,"opentel":558,"premium":561,"savedCards":564,"smallParcelSize":567,"yourPricesDrawer":570},{"_createdAt":508,"_updatedAt":509,"enabled":510},"2025-11-05T15:39:37.217Z","2025-11-05T15:39:37.452Z",true,{"_createdAt":512,"_updatedAt":513,"enabled":510},"2025-07-15T08:41:16.873Z","2025-10-28T11:52:03.675Z",{"_createdAt":515,"_updatedAt":516,"enabled":20},"2026-03-06T12:16:35.816Z","2026-03-06T12:16:36.662Z",{"_createdAt":518,"_updatedAt":519,"enabled":20},"2026-04-30T13:26:45.107Z","2026-04-30T13:26:45.355Z",{"_createdAt":521,"_updatedAt":522,"enabled":20},"2025-08-19T09:46:14.552Z","2025-09-02T10:23:26.02